abstract: >-
  Open a geospatial file and see it on a map and in a table, query it with
  spatial SQL, style it, and export it, without opening a desktop GIS. Ships as
  a VS Code extension and a web app from one codebase.
keywords:
  - GIS
  - spatial SQL
  - DuckDB
  - GeoParquet
  - GeoPackage
  - VS Code extension
